  "name": "eval-watch",
  "description": "Follow a kcap import that setup just started and the evals landing on it — \"Follow my kcap import\" (the prompt `kcap setup` hands to your agent), \"watch my import\", \"how is my import going\", \"are my evals done yet\". Reads the handoff file setup wrote, polls the eval state of exactly the sessions that import created, waits for the sessions that imported while the user watched to be evaluated, summarizes their evals, links to the results and offers the guided tour. Works on every plan. Not for browsing evals in general — that is the guided-tour skill.",
